{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217360","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217360","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1621736001:1":{"text":"The notes are meticulous, and the books are neatly arranged... I'm sure they belong to Girod!","source_cn":"如此工整严谨的笔记……排列整齐的书本……没错，这些肯定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B4F79B1CD4B950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621736002:1":{"text":"He's talented and hardworking at the same time! Respect!","source_cn":"没想到他不仅魔法天赋强，学习还这么认真，怪不得能成为优...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07635CD07BCDB157","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621736003:1":{"text":"But Girod isn't here. What can we do with his textbooks?","source_cn":"不过吉罗德不在这里，找到他的课本好像也没什么用处……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBD3AE8F7CE1EF3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621736004:1":{"text":"Well, if we can find his planner, we'll know where he went.","source_cn":"当然有用。如果能在桌上找到他的计划表，就能知道他去哪里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83CC7D95DE5B6310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621736005:1":{"text":"Seline, not everyone keeps a planner like you do.","source_cn":"赛琳，不是每个人都像你一样做每日计划表的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88B69BB0DA